  (text "MAINS SIDE - 100-240 V AC. Keep >= 6 mm to everything on the low-voltage side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d19d7270-6691-5c2f-829c-b36634c7e669"))
  (text "F1 before everything; RV1 across L/N after the fuse, at the module input." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 33.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f11995fe-c0fa-57ba-8c84-620e0d5409eb"))
  (text "5 V from the certified, isolated HLK-PM01 (3 kV AC). D1 stops USB back-feeding it." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120.65 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "e3fbd650-cbec-543d-9156-fe2011eb640f"))
  (text "XIAO ESP32-C6. Pin map fixed by the firmware: D0-D5 = GPIO 0, 1, 2, 21, 22, 23." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3d21b345-d105-5461-9913-4f10a31ef536"))
  (text "D6-D10 unused. BOOT (GPIO9) and RESET are the buttons on the XIAO itself." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 99.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "472b5bee-b092-585c-b9d7-9e6d441f57b9"))
  (text "Each input: 10k pull-up at the pin, 1k series, 10nF at the terminal side." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120.65 96.52 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "6a6c1757-6cfc-5f37-8f1d-6fdadc4eff86"))
  (text "Closed wall switch = pin to GND = active. Terminals are LOW VOLTAGE ONLY (3.3 V)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 120.65 99.06 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "a2b51cf4-dd61-5ee3-8768-8b012428f9ad"))
  (text "NEVER connect USB while the board is on mains. Uncertified design: installation by an electrician." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.32 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "7ba51673-368f-5655-9650-6f2afc5b5a33"))
